andle later fetch and retry; do not invent migration frameworks or stronger guarantees. Existing historical refs must remain inspectable through Git. Use focused local bare-remote integration tests, including recovery without original checkout and persistence failure, without live agents or live remote test data. Do not add protective policies without demonstrated need.\nDo not modify project files. Run relevant deterministic checks. Return approved only with no actionable findings and passing checks; otherwise changes_requested with concrete file/behavior findings, or blocked for a capability limitation.",
